STARTFONT 2.1
COMMENT Times Bold Italic 29px strike for CrossPoint Reader, filling the gap between
COMMENT the X.org Adobe 100dpi 18pt (25px) and 24pt (34px) strikes.
COMMENT Grid-fitted from URW Nimbus outlines, then hand-tuned pixel by pixel to
COMMENT the conventions of the Adobe strikes; accents composed from tuned parts.
FONT -CrossPoint-Times-Bold-I-Normal--29-210-100-100-P-146-ISO10646-1
SIZE 21 100 100
FONTBOUNDINGBOX 36 43 -6 -10
STARTPROPERTIES 21
FOUNDRY "CrossPoint"
FAMILY_NAME "Times"
WEIGHT_NAME "Bold"
SLANT "I"
SETWIDTH_NAME "Normal"
ADD_STYLE_NAME ""
PIXEL_SIZE 29
POINT_SIZE 210
RESOLUTION_X 100
RESOLUTION_Y 100
SPACING "P"
AVERAGE_WIDTH 146
CHARSET_REGISTRY "ISO10646"
CHARSET_ENCODING "1"
CAP_HEIGHT 20
X_HEIGHT 13
FONT_ASCENT 23
FONT_DESCENT 7
FACE_NAME "Times Bold Italic"
DEFAULT_CHAR 0
FULL_NAME "Times Bold Italic"
ENDPROPERTIES
